  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">年次有給休暇取得率の向上</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
